This license covers the Licium code written in this repository. Vendored
components keep their own licenses, which are compatible and preserved in
place:

  * MilkDrop 2 rendering engine and ns-eel2 — Copyright 2005-2013
    Nullsoft, Inc., BSD 3-Clause; originally written by Ryan Geiss.
    (License headers in the engine sources.)
  * Spout DirectX 9 SDK (vis_milk2/spout/) — Copyright (c) 2020-2024
    Lynn Jarvis, BSD 2-Clause; see vis_milk2/spout/LICENSE.
  * Winamp SDK headers (Winamp/, Wasabi/, Agave/, nu/) — Nullsoft,
    zlib-style permissive.
  * Curated palette data (vis_milk2/licium_palette_lib.h) — regenerated
    from the MIT-licensed repositories Experience-Monks/nice-color-palettes
    and mattdesl/dictionary-of-colour-combinations; see
    tools/gen_palette_lib.ps1.

The Licium logo, splash wordmark, and visual identity (brand/) are
Holly Watson's design — see brand/CREDITS.md. Attribution must be
preserved in source and in any distributed build.
